[32m+[m[32m`formulon` bridges theoretical formulations and numerical execution. Hot numerical loops are accelerated with **NumPy**, special functions are backed by **SciPy**, and pure recurrence-relation computations (e.g. Legendre/Laguerre/Hermite polynomials) are JIT-compiled with **Numba** in true `nopython` mode.[m
